 1 < n ∧ 1 < c.factor ∧ c.factor∣n-1 ∧ n < c.factor^2 ∧
 ∀ x∈c.entries, x.1.check=true ∧ (x.2:ZMod n)^(n-1)=1 ∧ Int.gcd (x.2^((n-1)/x.1.value)-1) (n:ℤ)=1 := by sorry
